                "message": "✨ Keep a chapter's own keywords in its parent's DEVONthink record\n\nA chapter has no record of its own, so its keywords had nowhere to live in\nDEVONthink. They are now stored in a block of their own in the comment of the\nparent's record, never as the parent's tags, and shown at the bottom of the\nchapter's litnote under a heading that names the book or collection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiDWYwkgX4eqm2SVoTC",
